    <string name="dedication_title">In Loving Memory of My Beloved Grandmother</string>
    <string name="dedication_arabic">اللهم اغفر لجدتي وارحمها، وعافها واعف عنها، وأكرم نزلها، ووسع مدخلها، واجعل قبرها روضة من رياض الجنة</string>
    <string name="dedication_translation">\"O Allah, forgive my grandmother and have mercy upon her, pardon her and grant her ease, honour her dwelling, expand her entrance, and make her grave a garden from the gardens of Paradise.\"</string>
    <string name="dua_request_notice">This application is a perpetual charity (Sadaqah Jariyah) without ads or fees. We respectfully ask everyone who uses this app to offer a heartfelt prayer (dua) for her mercy and eternal forgiveness.</string>
    <string name="dua_button">Ameen / دعاكم لها بالرحمة</string>

